  "description": "Si-On and Tae-Gon, the “Bottom X Bottom couple” who can't live without each other. Though they're inseparable in everyday life, there's one thing they can't resolve on their own. Namely, satisfying their sexual desires. To address this, they try inviting various men by mutual agreement, but no one who can truly satisfy them seems to show up. Just as they were about to give up, they meet Hyeon-U, a convenience store part-timer with a “huge one”...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
